veral restrictions can\nbe charged to their combined intersection and retained mass.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.combined_restriction","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.combined_restriction","tooltipHtml":"Successive normalizations cancel exactly, so several restrictions can\nbe charged to their combined intersection and retained mass."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction:assumption:Lax342547.Conditioning:0","e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The joint density constant increases by exactly the cost paid for the\nretained fraction; the comparison remains with the unconditioned law.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.density_after_restriction","tooltipHtml":"The joint density constant increases by exactly the cost paid for the\nretained fraction; the comparison remains with the unconditioned law."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction:assumption:Lax342547.Conditioning:0","e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"The numerator is an intersection with the tested event and can only\ndecrease. Its normalization costs the inverse retained mass.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction","tooltipHtml":"The numerator is an intersection with the tested event and can only\ndecrease. Its normalization costs the inverse retained mass."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal:assumption:Lax342547.Conditioning:0","e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"First compare the restricted mixed law pointwise to the original law,\nthen push this comparison through the projection. The original marginal\ncap is charged only the actual mixed-law normalization cost.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.filtered_marginal","tooltipHtml":"First compare the restricted mixed law pointwise to the original law,\nthen push this comparison through the projection. The original marginal\ncap is charged only the actual mixed-law normalization cost."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction:assumption:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.event_after_restriction:0","e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"A surviving fraction at least 2^(-zeta N) costs at most zeta N in the\nexponent. Since the tested rank is at least one, this fits the stated\nloss from 1-zeta to 1-2zeta uniformly over all ranks.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.minentropy_after_restriction","tooltipHtml":"A surviving fraction at least 2^(-zeta N) costs at most zeta N in the\nexponent. Since the tested rank is at least one, this fits the stated\nloss from 1-zeta to 1-2zeta uniformly over all ranks."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard:assumption:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard:0","e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"Divide the weighted discarded mass by the actual combined retained mass.\nA quantitative lower bound on that mass yields the exact exponential loss.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.restricted_discard","tooltipHtml":"Divide the weighted discarded mass by the actual combined retained mass.\nA quantitative lower bound on that mass yields the exact exponential loss."},"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard":{"href":"../lax-342547/Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard.html","incident":["e:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard:conclusion:Lax342547.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard:0"],"kind":"proof","label":"Each discarded contribution is at most its original weight times the\nthreshold. The total original weight is at most one.","nodeId":"p:Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard","semanticId":"Lax342547Proofs.LeafTrimming.weighted_discard","tooltipHtml":"Each discarded contribution is at most its original weight times the\nthreshold. The total original weight is at most one."}}},"status":"7 statements; 7 proofs","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"prepared-graph\" width=\"440\" height=\"449\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 449\" aria-label=\"Proof dependency graph\" data-layout-digest=\"86206099d7f33f9a9bfda549598090983e789fc9df52c90afc5b1175dee9c053\"><defs><marker id=\"graph-arrow-proof-network-86206099d7f33f9a-statements:Lax342547.LeafTrimming\" viewBox=\"0 -5 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"0\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto\" overflow=\"visible\"><path d=\"M1,-4.25 L9,0 L1,4.25 Q3,0 1,-4.25 Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-graph-camera><path class=\"graph